    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4480,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is the difference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5710,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between mass and weight? I think it's\nsomething that a lot of people are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10590,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "confused about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11490,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They just think that anything that's big\nlike this car"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15160,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has a lot of weight, is very heavy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18310,
    "dDurationMs": 4790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's gotta lot of mass and people just\nbasically think of these ideas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23100,
    "dDurationMs": 4349,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as all the same. But there's an important\ndistinction between the terms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27449,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mass and weight. Mass at first is the amount of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30769,
    "dDurationMs": 3511,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "matter in an object whereas weight is a\nforce."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34280,
    "dDurationMs": 4599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the gravitational attraction that\nthe object feels"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38879,
    "dDurationMs": 4971,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "towards in this case the Earth's center. So\ngot a little experiment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43850,
    "dDurationMs": 3950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "today where I brought my car at here and ask some people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47800,
    "dDurationMs": 5550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why is it difficult to push my car? And my bet is the answer will be because the car is heavy. (no duh)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53900,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because it's heavy. Because it's too heavy. (we get it, your car is heavy.)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60000,
    "dDurationMs": 1879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A big rock you would think would be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61879,
    "dDurationMs": 461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "heavy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62340,
    "dDurationMs": 5029,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's too heavy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67369,
    "dDurationMs": 5281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's been lighter than I thought. It is because its weight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72650,
    "dDurationMs": 4570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Weight is responsible. What is weight? Weight is mass in a gravity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77220,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What it this gravity thing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81080,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Gravity is what keeps ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82540,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*talking indecisively*"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85900,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your car is pulled towards at the center"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87969,
    "dDurationMs": 510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the earth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88479,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yes. But now when you push it, as in pushing your car, you are not pushing it up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92409,
    "dDurationMs": 3651,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you know what I mean? But it's still hard to push. Yeah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96060,
    "dDurationMs": 4030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So do you think weight is responsible for making it hard to push?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100090,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104500,
    "dDurationMs": 4310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I'm not trying\nto lift the car and I'm just trying to push it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111539,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A big rock you would think would\nbe heavy. Anything that is big"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115099,
    "dDurationMs": 4241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we think it would be heavy but I'm not\nlifting it on pushing so it's also gravity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119849,
    "dDurationMs": 3590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but this is my question right? but\nI'm not trying to lift it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123439,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, thats true. But it's\nstill hard to push."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126909,
    "dDurationMs": 3761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So why is that? because like if I\nlift it, I understand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130670,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you are saying it's heavy and it'd be really hard but we're pushing it actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134390,
    "dDurationMs": 939,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "getting it to go"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135329,
    "dDurationMs": 3841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how does that work. \nThe answer is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139170,
    "dDurationMs": 4090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the car has inertia. \nInertia means"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143260,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that objects with mass have a tendency to resist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146410,
    "dDurationMs": 3479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "changes in their motion. And I thought\nshe had a great answer when I started"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149889,
    "dDurationMs": 891,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which was inertia"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150780,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you tell us about that? What's inertia?\nIt's just like once something stops"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154100,
    "dDurationMs": 4009,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it doesn't really wanna go unless something is going. It doesn't mind and would stop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158109,
    "dDurationMs": 3551,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The idea that I'm trying to get\nis actually is that it's these are actually two different things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161660,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right? One thing is that there's a force\npulling a stand into the earth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165780,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's what we call weight and that\nmakes it impossible to lift"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169290,
    "dDurationMs": 3479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there's something else which is\ncalled inertia and that mean something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172769,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is difficult to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174069,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "change its motion because got a lot of\ninertia"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177549,
    "dDurationMs": 3541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's why it's difficult to push\nwhich is different than when it's difficult"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181090,
    "dDurationMs": 679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to lift."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181769,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which is the weight force pulling it down\ntowards here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184919,
    "dDurationMs": 4081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fair enough but it's actually not as\ndifficult to push. It's not that hard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189000,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yeah I know it doesn't prove my point (Subtitles by Jimena)"
    } ]
  } ]
